50980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Jay Maguire yells: My rockin' and rollin' beauties! You're in the right place to melt your face! Allow me to humbly introduce... Blight Booooar!\",\"id\":\"s0_1994\",\"timestamp\":1772767833},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: I will prove once and for all that only a knight from the grave can rule heavy metal.\",\"id\":\"s0_1995\",\"timestamp\":1772767842},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: Fight though you might, your bodies will freeze and shatter!\",\"id\":\"s0_1996\",\"timestamp\":1772767865},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kae Ti\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kae Ti says: Have a merry time on the merry-go-round!\",\"id\":\"s0_1997\",\"timestamp\":1772767909},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Death Metal Knight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Death Metal Knight yells: You have failed, Blight Boar.  Your fans now serve my armies of the dead!\",\"id\":\"s0_1998\",\"timestamp\":1772767918},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kae Ti\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kae Ti says: Have a merry time on the merry-go-round!\",\"id\":\"s0_1999\",\"timestamp\":177276