,\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Girthshaker-Kel'Thuzad\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Girthshaker-Kel'Thuzad:1461:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaGirthshaker|r]|h: It's beside the Bank Dai, bottom of the stairs to the right from the inn\",\"id\":\"s1_3059\",\"timestamp\":1773160297},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Daí-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Daí-Zul'jin:1486:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddDaí|r]|h: and i dont think those delves are in game yet\",\"id\":\"s1_3060\",\"timestamp\":1773160322},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"name\":\"Bumlock-BleedingHollow\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Bumlock-BleedingHollow:1502:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeBumlock|r]|h: so is there any reason to do this pvp quest? 4 weeks no ones gonna need that ring\",\"id\":\"s1_3061\",\"timestamp\":1773160358},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Daí-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Daí-Zul'jin:1513:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddDaí|r]|h: huh I have the pvp quest and the renown qust\",\"id\":\"s1_3062\",\"timestamp\":1773160393},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Daí-Zul'jin\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":