1773342398},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The Ranger-General was sharp and steadfast, while the peacekeeper kept the calm. Which path will you choose?\",\"id\":\"s2_3360\",\"timestamp\":1773342410},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Sylvanas didn't ask to be Ranger-General, but she gave everything to the task... including her life.\",\"id\":\"s2_3361\",\"timestamp\":1773342479},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: She trained with a bow gifted by our mother. Undead fanatics have invaded to loot it, and anything else that belonged to her.\",\"id\":\"s2_3362\",\"timestamp\":1773342517},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Typhonnis-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Typhonnis-Proudmoore receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|rx3.\",\"id\":\"s2_3363\",\"timestamp\":1773342634},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Our mother's bow meant everything to Sylvanas, once. I'll need it.\",\"id\":\"s2_3364\",\"timestamp\":1773342647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Typhonnis-Proudmoore\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Typhonnis-Proudmoore receives loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::90:1473:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s2_3365\",\"timestamp\":1773342671},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Latch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Latch yells: Latch... sorry...\",\"id\":\"s2_3366\",\"timestamp\":1773342735},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251083::::::::90:1473::23:4:12779:13439:6652:12701:1:28:3025:::::|h[Excavating Cudgel]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s2_3367\",\"timestamp\":1773342738},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 13 Gold, 24 Silver, 7 Copper\",\"id\":\"s2_3368\",\"timestamp\":1773342738},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Sylvanas was sometimes vain, and loved to be admired, but she never wanted to be worshipped.\",\"id\":\"s2_3369\",\"timestamp\":1773342740},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"tex