294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Dis must be de fire Lilaju spoke of.\",\"id\":\"s3_3136\",\"timestamp\":1773523451},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Sit and we will start de ritual--but be ready. Dis is de Loa of War. What ever he dreams of, we must complete de trial.\",\"id\":\"s3_3137\",\"timestamp\":1773523454},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Do not worry about your friend, de would-be hash'ey. Nalorakk, de dreamer, de Loa of War, will test her strength.\",\"id\":\"s3_3138\",\"timestamp\":1773523464},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: A hash'ey is only as strong as their warriors. So, you too will be tested in Nalorakk's dream.\",\"id\":\"s3_3139\",\"timestamp\":1773523475},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: The loa dreams of de Amani's past. When de winter was their only foe. Preparin' for it will be your first trial.\",\"id\":\"s3_3140\",\"timestamp\":1773523485},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Healslut-Deathwing\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\