:1773549075},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: Alas, if I had but one worthy customer...\",\"id\":\"s3_4271\",\"timestamp\":1773549092},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Classic Jewelcrafting skill.\",\"id\":\"s3_4272\",\"timestamp\":1773549101},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"You have gained the Midnight Jewelcrafting skill.\",\"id\":\"s3_4273\",\"timestamp\":1773549102},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: My sisters were the last to visit these halls, but they threw their home and their bond away. If we can calm the spirits here, maybe they'll return.\",\"id\":\"s3_4274\",\"timestamp\":1773549190},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TARGETICONS\",\"type\":\"TARGETICONS\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Angryabsol|h[Angryabsol]|h sets |TInterface\\\\TargetingFrame\\\\UI-RaidTargetingIcon_6:0|t on Friendly.\",\"id\":\"s3_4275\",\"timestamp\":1773549194},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The Ranger-General was sharp and steadfast, while the peacekeeper kept the calm. Which path will you choose?\",\"id\":\"s3_4276\",\"timestamp\":1773549203},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Discogoose-Thrall\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Discogoose-Thrall|h[|cff3fc7ebDiscogoose-Thrall|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61387:Player-3678-0B64334C:1:3:14:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Normal Mode I]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s3_4277\",\"timestamp\":1773549258},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: Vereesa was the peacekeeper of our family. She spent many days tending to the gardens here, but the wilderness has overtaken it now.\",\"id\":\"s3_4278\",\"timestamp\":1773549266},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Anetta-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anetta-Stormrage|h[|cfffff468Anetta|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61803:Player-60-0CB90919:1:3:14:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 7 (Season 1)]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s3_4279\",\"timestamp\":1773549299},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lirath Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lirath Windrunner says: The soothing sounds of my harp brought Vereesa joy beyond measure. I'll need that relic.\",\"