th'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"timestamp\":1773782482,\"id\":\"s4_4799\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Blue Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Blue Dragonflight Recruiter says: Ummm... excuse me... Ummm... Will you be matriculating at Algeth'ar Academy for the upcoming year? If so, have you considered pledging the Blue Dragonflight?\",\"timestamp\":1773782493,\"id\":\"s4_4800\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"timestamp\":1773782496,\"id\":\"s4_4801\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"timestamp\":1773782505,\"id\":\"s4_4802\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Well, it seems like things are in further disrepair than we anticipated.\",\"timestamp\":1773782507,\"id\":\"s4_4803\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: These lashers must have grown wild while we were away.\",\"timestamp\":1773782513,\"id\":\"s4_4804\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: Please, if you could, clear them out while we realign the life magics of this place?\",\"timestamp\":1773782518,\"id\":\"s4_4805\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Sçruffy-TheScryers\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sçruffy-TheScryers|h[|cffc41e3aSçruffy-TheScryers|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61797:Player-75-0FE40902:1:3:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[My Shady Nemesis]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773782530,\"id\":\"s4_4806\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Kovieyd-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kovieyd-Stormrage|h[|cffff7c0aKovieyd|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61487:Player-60-0FDB33A0:1:3:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Chimaerus, the Undreamt God]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1773782543,\"id\":\"s4_4807\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria say