588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Leftclick-Zul'jin|h[|cff3fc7ebLeftclick-Zul'jin|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61730:Player-61-07914198:1:3:18:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Twilight Crypts Stories]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s5_4114\",\"timestamp\":1773854256},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"id\":\"s5_4115\",\"timestamp\":1773854338},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter says: Step right up and pledge the Black Dragonflight. We are a sure in for winning the Lish Llrath Championships! Go Darkwings!\",\"id\":\"s5_4116\",\"timestamp\":1773854355},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"id\":\"s5_4117\",\"timestamp\":1773854408},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will 