-Lightbringer:735:PARTY:|h[|cff00ff98Konviks-Lightbringer|r]|h: gg\",\"timestamp\":1773885483,\"id\":\"s5_4642\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Bannedvokex-Area52\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.4627451300621033,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Bannedvokex-Area52:736:PARTY:|h[|cff33937fBannedvokex-Area52|r]|h: gg\",\"timestamp\":1773885486,\"id\":\"s5_4643\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Konviks-Lightbringer\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Konviks-Lightbringer receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49823::::::::90:105::23:5:12785:13439:6652:13577:12699:1:28:3025:::::|h[Cloak of the Fallen Cardinal]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773885487,\"id\":\"s5_4644\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Martin Victus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Martin Victus yells: Brave champions, we owe you our lives, our freedom.... Though it be a tiny gesture in the face of this enormous debt, I pledge that from this day forth, all will know of your deeds, and the blazing path of light you cut through the shadow of this dark citadel.\",\"timestamp\":1773885488,\"id\":\"s5_4645\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:2000|h[Loot]|h: You passed on: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:267007::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Eye of Acherus]|h|r |HlootHistory:2000|h|cnLOOT_LINK_COLOR:[View Loot Rolls]|r|h\",\"timestamp\":1773885490,\"id\":\"s5_4646\"},{\"