 Jaina Proudmoore says: The Frost Queen is gone. We must keep moving - our objective is near.\",\"timestamp\":1773885528,\"id\":\"s5_4656\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Your |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:12785:13439:6652:13577:12699:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12786:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773885589,\"id\":\"s5_4657\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Your |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12786:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12787:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773885589,\"id\":\"s5_4658\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Your |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12787:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12788:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773885590,\"id\":\"s5_4659\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Your |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12788:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12789:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773885590,\"id\":\"s5_4660\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"Your |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12789:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ4:|Hitem:49817::::::::90:105::23:5:13439:6652:13577:12699:12790:1:28:3025:::::|h[Shaggy Wyrmleather Leggings]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1773885590,\"id\":\"s5_4661\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"timestamp\":1773886024,\"id\":\"s5_4662\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Highwaym-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY\",\"type\":\"PARTY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party]|h |Hplayer:Highwaym-Stormrage:894:PARTY:|h[|cff00ff98Highwaym|r]|h: dungeon is on normal\",\"timestamp\":1773886032,\"id\":\"s5_4663\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"timestamp\":1773886033,\"id\":\"s5_4664\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will be. We are kind of a big deal.\",\"timestamp\":1773886036,\"id\":\"s5_4665\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Green Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Green Dragonflight Recruiter says: Hey, friend! I am still waking up, so please bear with me. Have you considered pledging the Green Dragonflight?\",\"timestamp\":1773886038,\"id\":\"s5_4666\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"timestamp\":1773886042,\"id\":\"s5_4667\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Blue Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Blue Dragonflight Recruiter says: Ummm... excuse me... Ummm... Will you be matriculating at Algeth'ar Academy for the upcoming year? If so, ha