,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: The way is open! Hurry, heroes!\",\"id\":\"s7_3321\",\"timestamp\":1774144692},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Locus-Walker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Locus-Walker says: It is rare that a naaru falls into Void this way. The few cases I know of have occurred when mortals were involved. What fascinating implications...\",\"id\":\"s7_3322\",\"timestamp\":1774144698},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Locus-Walker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Locus-Walker says: Such musings can wait, though. This entity must die.\",\"id\":\"s7_3323\",\"timestamp\":1774144712},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"HighmountainTauren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Maahun-Garona\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Maahun-Garona|h[|cff00ff98Maahun-Garona|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:12007:Player-104-0BFFED36:1:3:21:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Heroic: Seat of the Triumvirate]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s7_3324\",\"timestamp\":1774144843},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angryabsol-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"HighmountainTauren\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Maahun-Garona\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Maahun-Garona|h[|cff00ff98Maahun-Garona|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:12008:Player-104-0BFFED36:1:3:21:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mythic: Seat of the Triumvirate]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s7_3325\",\"timestamp\":1774144843},{\"recordedBy\":\"Angry