},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Nicktewdh yells: Such wondrous power! The Darkfallen Orb has made me INVINCIBLE!\",\"timestamp\":1775105969,\"id\":\"s11_3108\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Highwaym\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Highwaym yells: I have not come this far to be stopped! The future I have planned will not be jeopardized! Now you will taste true power!!\",\"timestamp\":1775106050,\"id\":\"s11_3109\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Shyvenei-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Shyvenei-Whisperwind|h[|cffc41e3aShyvenei-Whisperwind|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62168:Player-55-04DCA29F:1:4:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Insane Inventors (Nightmare)]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1775106111,\"id\":\"s11_3110\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Shyvenei-Whisperwind\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Shyvenei-Whisperwind|h[|cffc41e3aShyvenei-Whisperwind|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61898:Player-55-04DCA29F:1:4:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Gulf of Memory Discoveries]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1775106344,\"id\":\"s11_3111\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Highwaym-Stormrage\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PARTY_LEADER\",\"type\":\"PARTY_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.4627451300621033,\"g\":0.7843137979507446,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:PARTY|h[Party Leader]|h |Hplayer:Highwaym-Stormrage:3598:PARTY:|h[|cff00ff98Highwaym|r]|h: |cffe6cc80|Hgarrmission:mdt-Highwaym+Stormrage|h[Algethar Academy: Default]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1775107768,\"id\":\"s11_3112\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"timestamp\":1775108037,\"id\":\"s11_3113\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter says: Step right up and pledge the Black Dragonflight. We are a sure in for winning the Lish Llrath Championships! Go Darkwings!\",\"timestamp\":1775108041,\"id\":\"s11_3114\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"timestamp\":1775108046,\"id\":\"s11_3115\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will be. We are kind of a big deal.\",\"timestamp\":1775108048,\"id\":\"s11_3116\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Well, it seems like things are in further disrepair than we anticipated.\",\"timestamp\":1775108053,\"id\":\"s11_3117\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"timestamp\":1775108055,\"id\":\"s11_3118\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: These lashers must have grown wild while we were away.\",\"timestamp\":1775108059,\"id\":\"s11_3119\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: Please, if you could, clear them out while we realign the life magics of this place?\",\"timestamp\":1775108064,\"id\":\"s11_3120\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Bronze Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":