:1279:::::|h[Void-Linked Robe]|h|r was changed to |cnIQ4:|Hitem:151325::::::::90:1473::33:5:13440:42:13577:12699:12798:1:28:1279:::::|h[Void-Linked Robe]|h|r.\",\"timestamp\":1775376451,\"id\":\"s12_3761\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3345:0|h[Hero Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s12_3762\",\"timestamp\":1775438943},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"id\":\"s12_3763\",\"timestamp\":1775439048},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Black Dragonflight Recruiter says: Step right up and pledge the Black Dragonflight. We are a sure in for winning the Lish Llrath Championships! Go Darkwings!\",\"id\":\"s12_3764\",\"timestamp\":1775439053},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"id\":\"s12_3765\",\"timestamp\":1775439058},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will be. We are kind of a big deal.\",\"id\":\"s12_3766\",\"timestamp\":1775439059},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"id\":\"s12_3767\",\"timestamp\":1775439066},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Well, it seems like things are in further disrepair than we anticipated.\",\"id\":\"s12_3768\",\"timestamp\":1775439066},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: These lashers must have grown wild while we were away.\",\"id\":\"s12_3769\",\"timestamp\":1775439072},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: Please, if you could, clear them out while we realign the life magics of this place?\",\"id\":\"s12_3770\",\"timestamp\":1775439077},{\"recordedBy\":\"Barelynoer-Area52\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragos