ive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:191398::::::::90:105:::::::::|h[Potion of Gusts |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-Tier3:17:15::1|a]|h|rx20\",\"id\":\"s16_3671\",\"timestamp\":1776657519},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:256625::::::::90:105::16::1:28:1279:::::|h[Pattern: Hexwoven Strand]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s16_3672\",\"timestamp\":1776657519},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Anabolyc-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anabolyc-Tichondrius|h[|cff33937fAnabolyc-Tichondrius|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61235:Player-11-0E44A7A1:1:4:19:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Season 1: Resilient Keystone 13]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s16_3673\",\"timestamp\":1776657533},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Anabolyc-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Anabolyc-Tichondrius|h[|cff33937fAnabolyc-Tichondrius|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61236:Player-11-0E44A7A1:1:4:19:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Season 1: Resilient Keystone 14]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s16_3674\",\"timestamp\":1776657533},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa yells: Welcome to Algeth'ar Academy! I am delighted that you received our invitation. The school is a touch behind schedule, but I have heard wondrous things about your capabilities. Perhaps you could help us?\",\"id\":\"s16_3675\",\"timestamp\":1776657552},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"id\":\"s16_3676\",\"timestamp\":1776657561},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will be. We are kind of a big deal.\",\"id\":\"s16_3677\",\"timestamp\":1776657564},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Well, it seems like things are in further disrepair than we anticipated.\",\"id\":\"s16_3678\",\"timestamp\":1776657568},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"id\":\"s16_3679\",\"timestamp\":1776657570},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: These lashers must have grown wild while we were away.\",\"id\":\"s16_3680\",\"timestamp\":1776657574},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headteacher Doragosa says: It appears some new students have trickled in after you. They seem interested in our sports field. Help them sort out clearing the place, it is in quite a state.\",\"id\":\"s16_3681\",\"timestamp\":1776657583},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mystic Birdhat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mystic Birdhat says: There is nothing in all Pandaria that can stay the rampage of the Grand Expedition Yak. Pray you never see it.\",\"id\":\"s16_3682\",\"timestamp\":1776657661},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"UNKNOWN\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BN_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"BN_WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.9647059440612793,\"g\":1,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"To [???]: Just tried it on my druid that's wasy easier than on the evoker lol\",\"id\":\"s16_3683\",\"timestamp\":1776657681},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Green Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Green Dragonflight Recruiter says: Hey, friend! I am still waking up, so please bear with me. Have you considered pledging the Green Dragonflight?\",\"id\":\"s16_3684\",\"timestamp\":1776657691},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\