or Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: New students! How wonderful. It has been quite some time since the Academy has been open.\",\"id\":\"s16_3826\",\"timestamp\":1776659500},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Red Dragonflight Recruiter says: Greetings! Have you considered pledging the Red Dragonflight? Anyone who is anyone will be. We are kind of a big deal.\",\"id\":\"s16_3827\",\"timestamp\":1776659502},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Well, it seems like things are in further disrepair than we anticipated.\",\"id\":\"s16_3828\",\"timestamp\":1776659507},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Ichistrasz\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Ichistrasz says: Indeed! Come with us! It should only take a moment to set up for a new lesson.\",\"id\":\"s16_3829\",\"timestamp\":1776659509},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Professor Mystakria\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Professor Mystakria says: These lashers must have grown wild while we were away.\",\"id\":\"s16_3830\",\"timestamp\":1776659513},{\"recordedBy\":\"Lonelylitten-Stormrage\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headteacher Doragosa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"ty